      "created_at": "2016-11-24T12:22:32Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-11-24T12:22:32Z",
      "body": "An emergency valve has its value. A problem with federation is you couldn't really hide and protect your existing posts, but at least your new ones would be safe.",
